2026-10-06T04:00:52.2443882Z Description:
2026-10-06T04:00:52.2445458Z   forge — Mission Control Language runtime
2026-10-06T04:00:52.2445748Z 
2026-10-06T04:00:52.2445854Z Usage:
2026-10-06T04:00:52.2446091Z   forge [command] [options]
2026-10-06T04:00:52.2446315Z 
2026-10-06T04:00:52.2446474Z Options:
2026-10-06T04:00:52.2446797Z   -?, -h, --help  Show help and usage information
2026-10-06T04:00:52.2447238Z   --version       Show version information
2026-10-06T04:00:52.2447520Z 
2026-10-06T04:00:52.2447609Z Commands:
2026-10-06T04:00:52.2447966Z   init <mission>             Resolve expert sources and generate mcl.lock
2026-10-06T04:00:52.2449133Z   run <mission>              Run a mission
2026-10-06T04:00:52.2450229Z   validate <mission>         Validate a mission file and its expert references
2026-10-06T04:00:52.2450794Z   list                       List available resources
2026-10-06T04:00:52.2451160Z   expert                     Manage experts
2026-10-06T04:00:52.2451505Z   registry                   OCI registry operations
2026-10-06T04:00:52.2452013Z   login                      Sign in to Forge (browser) and store a platform key
2026-10-06T04:00:52.2452493Z   whoami                     Show the signed-in Forge user and credit balance
2026-10-06T04:00:52.2453069Z   logout                     Sign out of Forge (remove the stored platform key)
2026-10-06T04:00:52.2453587Z   exec <target> <prompt>     Run a hosted mission once and print the answer
2026-10-06T04:00:52.2454120Z   chat                       Chat with a hosted mission in the current Forge project
2026-10-06T04:00:52.2454626Z   project                    Manage portable Forge projects
2026-10-06T04:00:52.2455218Z   publish <reference> <dir>  Package a mission directory into a self-contained OCI artifact and push it
2026-10-06T04:00:52.2455840Z   clean                      Remove cached OCI experts from ~/.forge/experts
2026-10-06T04:00:52.2456416Z   serve <agent>              Serve a mission as an OpenAI-compatible endpoint
2026-10-06T04:00:52.2456955Z   claude <target>            Launch Claude Code talking to a forge mission
2026-10-06T04:00:52.2457522Z   connect                    Wire an editor's Claude Code extension to a forge mission
2026-10-06T04:00:52.2458013Z   agent                      Manage forge agents running in Docker
2026-10-06T04:00:52.2458765Z   webui                      Manage Open WebUI connected to a forge agent
2026-10-06T04:00:52.2459765Z   provider                   Manage LLM provider profiles
2026-10-06T04:00:52.2460438Z   mcp <mission>              Expose a mission as a stdio MCP server (for Claude Desktop and MCP-aware tools)
2026-10-06T04:00:52.2460812Z 
